    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dans une petite ville perdue au milieu de nulle part, le commerce de pompes fun\u00e8bres d\u2019Edmond Zweck bat de l\u2019aile. L\u2019entreprise ne compte plus que deux employ\u00e9s: Georges, le bras droit de Zweck, et Eddy, un jeune homme encore novice dans le m\u00e9tier. Un beau matin, pourtant, un mort pointe son nez. L\u2019espoir rena\u00eet. Georges et Eddy sont charg\u00e9s de mener le d\u00e9funt jusqu\u2019\u00e0 sa derni\u00e8re demeure. Mais, \u00e0 la recherche du cimeti\u00e8re qui s\u2019av\u00e8re introuvable, le convoi fun\u00e9raire s\u2019\u00e9gare et le voyage tourne au fiasco.",
        "english": "In a small town in the middle of nowhere, Edmond Zweck's funeral home is struggling to make ends meet. Zweck now only has two employees, his right-hand man, Georges, and young Eddy, who is new to the business. One fine morning, a dead body turns up at last, and their hope is renewed. Georges and Eddy are sent out to deliver the coffin to its final resting place. But they can't find the cemetery and get separated from the funeral procession, as the journey quickly turns into a fiasco."
    },
